==============================================================================
A1.4  how good is the optimal-beta proxy itself?
==============================================================================
  The target v_next assumes the content written at address
  k = normalize(W_k emb(s)) is what gets read back by
  q = normalize(W_q emb(s)). Those are different learned
  projections of the same token, so the proxy is only as tight as
  their alignment. Per symbol, over the whole vocabulary:
    cos(k_s, q_s)  same symbol : mean +0.8559  min +0.8152  max +0.8810
    cos(k_s, q_r)  different   : mean -0.0615  sd 0.0378
    margin (same - mean other) +0.9174
  A1b measures actual cross-entropy and so needs none of this; it
  is the validity check on A1's ranking, not on A1b's.

